{"id":"f8670aa71d18ef9d","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-isotopy.md","title":"Isotopy","display":"df-isotopy — Isotopy","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-isotopy","aliases":["58-df-isotopy","Isotopy"],"display":"df-isotopy — Isotopy","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","[[58-df-homeomorphism]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-continuous-map]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-isotopy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-isotopy</span><span>Isotopy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-isotopy — Isotopy"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca7fc3ab38a11801\" href=\"?note=ca7fc3ab38a11801\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md\">../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"58-df-homeomorphism\">58-df-homeomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology\">58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,M,N,\\tau_X,\\tau_M,\\tau_N,H,\\phi,\\psi\\in V\">\\(X,M,N,\\tau_X,\\tau_M,\\tau_N,H,\\phi,\\psi\\in V\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,1]\">\\(I=[0,1]\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathbb R}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathbb R}=\\{U\\subseteq\\mathbb R:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists\\varepsilon\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;((x-\\varepsilon,x+\\varepsilon)\\subseteq U)\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_I=\\{U\\cap I:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\">\\(\\tau_I=\\{U\\cap I:U\\in\\tau_{\\mathbb R}\\}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Homeo}_S,\\mathrm{Embedding}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Homeo}_S,\\mathrm{Embedding}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"c4b4a825f2ea608d\" href=\"?note=c4b4a825f2ea608d\" title=\"58-df-homeomorphism\">58-df-homeomorphism</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology\">58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Isotopy}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Isotopy}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AmbientIsotopy}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{AmbientIsotopy}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsotopyEquiv}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{IsotopyEquiv}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> are defined here.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>正文的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\times I\">\\(X\\times I\\)</span> 用有序对编码，故采用所引 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S\\)</span>，不采用有限函数族乘积载体。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isotopy} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Isotopy}_S(H,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{X,I\\})\\land\\vec X(0)=X\\land\\vec X(1)=I\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau_X,\\tau_I\\})\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\tau_X\\land\\vec\\tau(1)=\\tau_I\\land\n\\tau=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,I,\\tau_I)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(H,X\\times I,X)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\tau,X,\\tau_X)\\land\n\\forall t\\in I\\;\\exists h\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(h(x)=H(\\langle x,t\\rangle))\\land\n\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isotopy} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Isotopy}_S(H,X)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_X,\\vec X,\\vec\\tau,\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec X,2,\\{X,I\\})\\land\\vec X(0)=X\\land\\vec X(1)=I\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\vec\\tau,2,\\{\\tau_X,\\tau_I\\})\\land\\vec\\tau(0)=\\tau_X\\land\\vec\\tau(1)=\\tau_I\\land\n\\tau=\\mathrm{BinaryProductTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,I,\\tau_I)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}(H,X\\times I,X)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(H,X\\times I,\\tau,X,\\tau_X)\\land\n\\forall t\\in I\\;\\exists h\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(h,X,X)\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(h(x)=H(\\langle x,t\\rangle))\\land\n\\mathrm{Homeo}_S(h,X,\\tau_X,X,\\tau_X)\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ambient\\text{-}isotopy} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AmbientIsotopy}_S(H,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Isotopy}_S(H,M)\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)=x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ambient\\text{-}isotopy} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{AmbientIsotopy}_S(H,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Isotopy}_S(H,M)\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;(H(\\langle x,0\\rangle)=x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isotopy\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{IsotopyEquiv}_S(\\phi,\\psi,N,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_N,\\tau_M,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Embedding}_S(\\phi,N,\\tau_N,M,\\tau_M)\\land\n\\mathrm{Embedding}_S(\\psi,N,\\tau_N,M,\\tau_M)\\land\n\\mathrm{AmbientIsotopy}_S(H,M)\\land\n\\forall x\\in N\\;(H(\\langle\\phi(x),1\\rangle)=\\psi(x))\n\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}isotopy\\text{-}equivalence} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{IsotopyEquiv}_S(\\phi,\\psi,N,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\tau_N,\\tau_M,H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Embedding}_S(\\phi,N,\\tau_N,M,\\tau_M)\\land\n\\mathrm{Embedding}_S(\\psi,N,\\tau_N,M,\\tau_M)\\land\n\\mathrm{AmbientIsotopy}_S(H,M)\\land\n\\forall x\\in N\\;(H(\\langle\\phi(x),1\\rangle)=\\psi(x))\n\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Isotopy: continuous family of homeomorphisms; stronger than homotopy</li>\n<li>Homeomorphism group: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_0(\\operatorname{Homeo}(M))\">\\(\\pi_0(\\operatorname{Homeo}(M))\\)</span> = isotopy classes</li>\n<li>Kirby calculus: isotopy of handle decompositions; moves on link diagrams</li>\n<li>Knot theory: ambient isotopy = equivalence of knots; isotopic embeddings</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Kirby, Foundational Essays on Topological Manifolds</li>\n<li>Ranicki, Algebraic and Geometric Surgery</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca7fc3ab38a11801","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-euclidean-topological-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-homeomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"c4b4a825f2ea608d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-homeomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"",